        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x+5&=1\\\\2x&=-4\\\\x&=-2\\end{align*}$$\nCheck:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=5(-2)+5=-5\\\\\\text{RHS}&=3(-2)+1=-5\\end{align*}$$\nBoth sides are equal.",
