        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=1$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5x+15&=20\\\\5x&=5\\\\x&=1\\end{align*}$$\nCheck:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=7(1)+15=22\\\\\\text{RHS}&=2(1)+20=22\\end{align*}$$\nBoth sides are equal.",
